; spells.eval - the reworked spell tiers (docs/spell-updates-plan.md), one
; section per outcome. tools\SpellTest.py runs this and JUDGES it; on its own it
; only reports. Every section header is `=== <name> ===` and the judge reads the
; readouts between one header and the next, so a section must stay self-contained.
;
; Maren (member 2) casts unless a section says otherwise. Her hands start as the
; starter kit has them (fire left, project right); a section that needs the right
; hand clear puts the project rune back first. Power is moved with `setskill`:
; school level 0 reaches no threshold, level 30 reaches all of them.
logecho on
reset
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 11
goto crypt1
learn 2 fire
learn 2 earth
learn 2 air
learn 2 water

; --- TIER 1: the hand spells -------------------------------------------------

echo === flame-held ===
equip torch 2 1
cast 2 0 fire
torch

echo === flame-walltorch ===
equip rune_project 2 1
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc douse
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 fire
castsvc fire

echo === flame-brazier-weak ===
tp 8 4
face e
castsvc douse
cast 2 0 fire
castsvc fire

echo === flame-brazier-strong ===
setskill 2 fire 30
cast 2 0 fire
castsvc fire

echo === gust-flare ===
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 air
castsvc fire

echo === splash-brazier-weak ===
step 2
cast 2 0 water
castsvc fire

echo === splash-brazier-strong ===
setskill 2 water 30
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 water
castsvc fire

echo === splash-walltorch ===
setskill 2 water 0
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 water
castsvc fire

echo === splash-fill ===
equip waterskin_empty 2 1
cast 2 0 water
torch
cast 2 0 water
torch
cast 2 0 water
torch
equip rune_project 2 1

echo === pebble-hand ===
learn 0 earth
cast 0 0 earth
torch

echo === pebble-feet ===
cast 0 0 earth
castsvc floor

; Leave crypt1 with its torch still out (splash-walltorch), so the level is
; STASHED doused; a new game must find it lit again (it once came back out - the
; stash kept the flag). Before any save or load: this exact order is the one that
; showed it. A real `newgame`, not `reset`: a reset forgets every stash
; (code-review C300), so it would read crypt1 from its file and never reach the
; stash this guards - a new game in a running world keeps it.
echo === newgame-relights ===
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire
goto eval_arena
newgame
goto crypt1
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire

; A save made with the torch out must bring it back out over a relight.
echo === douse-saveload ===
castsvc douse
save spells_douse
castsvc light
castsvc fire
load spells_douse
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire

echo === gust-shove ===
goto eval_arena
learn 2 air
arena open 9 9
freeze on
tp 14 12
face n
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
cast 2 0 air
monsters
setskill 2 air 30
cast 2 0 air
monsters

; --- MEMORIZE: offered only for a rune its holder does not know ----------------
; The new game above handed Maren her kit: Ingwaz in pack slot 0, Hagalaz in 1. The
; details dialog's button learns Ingwaz and spends it; a second Ingwaz then offers
; no button and stays in the pack; the dialog opened on no one's item has none.

echo === memorize-details ===
itemdetails pack 2 0
itemdetails status
itemdetails memorize
inventory status
give rune_multiple 2
itemdetails pack 2 0
itemdetails status
itemdetails memorize
itemdetails off
inventory status
itemdetails rune_explode
itemdetails status
itemdetails off

; --- THE GRAMMAR: school, form, then one modifier ------------------------------

; The new game above forgot every rune Maren learned, so the rest relearn them.
echo === grammar ===
learn 2 fire
learn 2 earth
learn 2 project
learn 2 protect
learn 2 sight
learn 2 multiple
learn 2 explode
setskill 2 fire 10
setskill 2 earth 10
cast 2 0 fire multiple
cast 2 0 fire multiple project
cast 2 0 fire project multiple explode
cast 2 0 fire sight multiple
heal
cast 2 0 fire project

; --- TIER 2 and 3: bolts and their modifiers -----------------------------------

; --- THE BOOK: a Cast refused for want of mana keeps the spell built ----------
; Four Fire Bolts (8 mana each) leave Maren short; the book's Cast is then
; refused and the slate must still hold the spell. After a heal it casts, and
; the slate empties.
echo === book-nomana ===
heal
cast 2 0 fire project
cast 2 0 fire project
cast 2 0 fire project
cast 2 0 fire project
party
book 2
book spell fire project
book cast
heal
book cast
book off

echo === firebolt ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
heal
tp 14 14
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 11 south 4
spawn skel_warrior 13 11 south 4
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire project
step 3
tally
monsters

echo === volley ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
heal
tp 14 14
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 11 south 4
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire project multiple
step 4
tally
; What a volley bolt LEAVES: the volley's own on-hit (spells.cat [firebolt_volley]
; on_hit = burn 1 4), not its form's (firebolt's burn 2 4) - its own entry was
; read by nothing (code-review C19).
monsters

echo === burst ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
heal
tp 14 14
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 11 south 4
spawn skel_warrior 13 11 south 4
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire project explode
step 4
tally
monsters

echo === ward-self ===
heal
cast 2 0 earth protect
char 0
char 2

echo === ward-party ===
heal
cast 2 0 earth protect multiple
char 0
char 1
char 2
char 3

echo === ward-burst ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
tp 14 12
face n
heal
; Mummies, not skeletons: since lighting-updates Phase 6 every skeleton
; resists fire (0.75), and this burst is fire.
spawn mummy 14 11 south
spawn mummy 13 12 east
spawn mummy 15 12 west
spawn mummy 14 13 north
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire protect explode
step 3
tally
monsters
party
char 2

; --- MONSTER CASTERS -----------------------------------------------------------

echo === adept ===
arena open 9 9
heal
tp 14 14
face n
freeze off
tally reset
spawn skel_mage_adept 14 11 south
step 6
tally

