tally reset
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
step 0.1
castsvc repel 30 2
