; --- THE MAGUS'S BURST REACHES THE PARTY (code-review C1) -----------------------
; Its bolt BURSTS: one that reaches the party is its blast, going off in the
; party's square - it used to strike one member as a plain firebolt and be
; retired with the blast unspent. Three squares off, since a firebolt flies 8 m.
; A bolt that flew past the party and burst on the wall behind would count a
; blast too, but with an expiry, so the judge reads both. Last, so the fights
; above draw the combat RNG exactly as they did before it was added.
echo === magus ===
arena open 9 9
heal
tp 14 14
face n
freeze off
tally reset
spawn skel_magus 14 11 south
step 6
tally

; --- A LIGHT RUNNING OUT SAYS SO (code-review C9) -------------------------------
; A Firelight on Maren, left to run out, ends with ITS OWN line, naming the light -
; never the Sight spell's ("The stone closes to Maren's sight."), which every
; carried Sowilo light used to end with: the party's expiry line was picked by
; the effect's CATEGORY, and a light is a Marker as Sight is. A world line goes to
; the HUD's message log and nowhere else, so `messages` reads it there. Its own
; reset, and after everything above, so it changes no fight's dice.
echo === light-fades ===
reset
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 11
goto eval_arena
arena open 9 9
heal
learn 2 fire
learn 2 light
; skilled enough that a two-rune cast cannot fumble
setskill 2 fire 5
cast 2 fire light
char 2
step 400
messages 30
echo === end ===
